<title>USA: Webline names former Avid president as CEO.</title>
<headline>Webline names former Avid president as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internet commerce firm WebLine Communications Corp on Monday said it named Daniel Keshian its president, chief executive and a board member.</p>
<p>Keshian was president of Avid Technology Inc from January to September 1996, when he resigned.</p>
